gweni provides CMake targets:

    find_package(gweni CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE gweni::gweni)
    # the textured skin's files where RelativeToExecutablePaths("resources") finds them
    gweni_add_resources(main)

On the web (wasm32-emscripten) the app sets its own stack and heap; the
layout and render walks recurse once per tree level:

    target_link_options(main PRIVATE -sALLOW_MEMORY_GROWTH=1 -sSTACK_SIZE=4MB)
